[00:00.51]Close your eyes
{"闭上双眼"}
[00:02.75]Only got one night
{"仅此一夜"}
[00:04.78]Just put your trust in me
{"只需将信任交予我"}
[00:06.61]Give me everything
{"给我你的一切"}
[00:08.84]I need your love tonight
{"今夜我渴望你的爱"}
[00:10.67]So baby please don't fight it
{"亲爱的请别抗拒"}
[00:13.31]Put your trust in me
{"将信任交予我"}
[00:14.74]I'll give you everything
{"我会给你全世界"}
[00:16.97]
[00:17.17]So hold on to me
{"请紧紧抱住我"}
[00:23.67]Never let me go
{"永远别放手"}
[00:25.91]Right here in your arms
{"就在你臂弯里"}
[00:27.93]This is where i wanna be
{"此心安处是吾乡"}
[00:32.21]So hold on to me
{"请紧紧抱住我"}
[00:39.93]Look me in the eyes
{"凝视我的双眼"}
[00:41.95]Under the night sky for eternity
{"在永恒夜空下相拥"}
